_name": "3.png", "id": "213742845042920", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75286675_213742848376253_3538306338887601318_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iYIShcQKlo4Q7kNvwHIz9Pn&_nc_oc=AdpLxJCV8sSXlzkBsj8QbBeguwGQvzrXqZDEVjvKMHRMyY3YgAHp1k2i5xjO4So6_ns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWKC-swwyOTyYBUMkXbUYhzAl8PdLKFcQaLa89GlakzsA&oe=6B103B30"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "198159856616367", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031495_198159859949700_3359487543079529795_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YN6YjaRhbKEQ7kNvwF91y_P&_nc_oc=Ado2ql6Svnqs_N17R19V7Wf1H_l4psKAHf4obWmYDjleP5IjV11DQ5LcvH72ZKJhQmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUjnt59X9UYPGUFFPx4nvWRa0Fnl6-7ZvpzfzTiTo4ccA&oe=6B104F54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Logo_Applab.png", "id": "672863444779976", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75303838_672863448113309_8226459743149731752_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PeXyZ63GDZ8Q7kNvwGSaj3V&_nc_oc=AdrZoWIMJtd3ynV-mQf9bP3jDNJK5Qee3Jgn1kO5ox9FiHuguommn5hzOGhY3B2Zmww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUTcNZua0gWyRqO2OHspz7PRUwiKrojNVSXHUMNFhPqHw&oe=6B104DC4"}, "display_name": "Just Another Cooking Game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "NOTE: This app is part of a university research study and contains a SURVEY only in the \"Experience\" level. After that, you unlock the game with no more surveys.\n\nJust Another Cooking Game is a time management game inspired by several other cooking games such as Overcooked and Cook-Out. \n\nPlay the experience to unlock 12 more levels.\nServe all robots as fast as possible to unlock the next level.\nCook Under Pressure and see if you can handle the heat!\n", "short_description": "NOTE: This a